	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat020160"},
		line=1692,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm going with Hotori.”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"I declare without hesitation.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Even Akari ordered me to support Hotori however I can.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But you're coming with us, Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll be fine on my own.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'll be fine, too. You go protect Miyaguni.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, you're going with Inou.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"The debate reaches another impasse.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Ina Koyuzu, requesting permission to speak!”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What is it?”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“What if we were to check the dungeon first, then go search for the Treasures?”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If Maki's there waiting for us, he'll keep us tied down. We\nwon't have time to look for the Treasures.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Fine, I get it!”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Koyuzu crosses her arms and strikes an exaggerated pose.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I shall go look for the Treasures myself.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“As much as it breaks my heart to leave Hotori-sama's side, we won't get anywhere at this rate.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“All right. Counting on you, Koyuzu.”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you two okay with this?”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Fine by me.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thanks, Koyuzu.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“In that case, Koyuzu, let me give you a quick rundown.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"The two begin poring over Koyuzu's map and fall into deep discussion.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"There are surely lots of secret passages that only Akari knows about.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, shouldn't you be prioritizing your lord?”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're just as important to me.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I meant it when I told you I'd always stay by your side.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Well, yeah, but...”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Hotori trails off bashfully, her wandering gaze refusing to meet my own.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...Alright.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If that's what you've decided, we'll just have to rescue Father twice as fast.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"The three of us part ways with Koyuzu and head for the dungeon.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kh...”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"Akari screws up her brow with a faint groan.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"A putrid smell drifts up toward us from the dungeons below.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"The smell of rotting flesh.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"As the gentle flickering of the lamps beckons us deeper and deeper, the solid stone lining our path gives way to rows upon rows of rusted iron bars.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"My instincts tingle, instantly putting me on guard.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“He's here.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Squinting into the depths of the inky darkness, I silently draw my blade.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"My eyes eventually land upon a man whose faint silhouette clings to the shadows.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Took your sweet-ass time, didn't you?”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Maki...”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"Maki steps forward into the flickering lamplight.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"At his feet, a slowly expanding pool of blood radiates a dim luster.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you alone?”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Yeah. Been waitin' for you all this while.”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Damn near bored me outta my mind, so I might've jumped the gun a little.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"Maki listlessly kicks the man lying at his feet.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Fa... ther...?”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"The emaciated corpse rolls over several times before coming to a halt.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"There isn't a single digit remaining on his hands or feet, and his ankles have deep scars carved into them.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"His tendons were cut such that he was deprived of even the ability to walk.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"He bears all the marks of a horrific ordeal of torture.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Just to be clear, I ain't the one who tortured him.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“He was already on death's door, so I just put him out of his misery. And lookie 'ere at his next of kin showin' up just in time to kiss my feet and thank me.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Tell you what, I'll even let you drag the body home.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"Hotori wordlessly raises her blade.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Don't look at me like that, dammit.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I also would've preferred to waste Kokuan while he could still put up a fight.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“But y'know, ain't no point in lettin' him live on as a useless sack of shit like this.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“In this state, he'd only ruin the Blades’ morale.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Curse you!”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"Hotori's fury bears down on Maki like a gale.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"Sparks fly and illuminate the dark dungeon with their spectacle.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"Maki doesn't take a single step back, receiving her strike head-on.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Sure you still wanna hold back like that?”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Khhh!”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori!”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Stay out of this!”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...All right.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"This is Hotori's fight.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"I need to see it through on the sidelines.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I challenge you to single combat, Maki!”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Here and now, I shall avenge my father.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Been waitin' this whole damn time, Inou!”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Maki takes his distance with a mighty sweep of his blade.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"It would be all too easy for him to take the head of anyone who recklessly tries to close the distance.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"Yet Hotori fearlessly steps forward anyways.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"She crouches low, and Maki's blade swipes right above where her neck was a moment ago.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"A blindingly fast counter-thrust.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"The brilliant streak of her blade bears down on Maki like a falling star.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Whoa there!”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ngh!”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Hotori's body is sent recoiling backwards.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"Maki's foot crunches squarely into her jaw.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Don't get ahead of yourself...”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"His colossal blade howls as it swings mercilessly down.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou!”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Gwah!”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Hotori tumbles roughly across the cobblestones like a marble.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"...But she's still all in one piece.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"She barely managed to block the attack not an instant too late.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“*Cough...!* Ngh...”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"Maki gives her a pitying look as she staggers to her feet.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You ain't lookin' so hot, Inou.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm not done yet!”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"Once again, blades clash and sparks fly.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"With nothing but revenge on her mind, Hotori single-mindedly presses her attack with reckless abandon.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"On the other hand, Maki still has the presence of mind to crack a smile, hardly breaking a sweat.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Every hero's gotta eventually meet their end.”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“That day in August, Kokuan fought to the last to protect everyone, and he died with his spirit unbroken even after\nbein' tortured to hell an' back.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“After that, his daughter stands up for herself and avenges him.”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Ain't that a nice story to tell?!”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You dare to mock me?!”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"Hotori desperately swings down with all her might.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"But Maki dodges it all too easily.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"Not a second later, his counterattack pierces Hotori's guard like a bolt of lightning.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Khh!”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"The tip of his blade grazes her even as she leaps back reflexively.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"It draws a thin arc across the cobblestones, leaving behind a pattern of fresh crimson.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"Hotori's wound is thankfully shallow, based on the amount of blood dripping down.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"But it is clear as day that she is losing ground by the moment.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You're boring as all hell...”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"Maki's blade screams through the air, and Hotori barely manages to parry it in time.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"Yet not a second later, Maki's second strike rends through the air from the complete opposite direction, wrenching the blade from her hands.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"It tumbles through the air before burying itself in the ground several dozen paces away.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“!”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“What's the matter?”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You got another one right there, don't you?”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Maki growls, his eyes firmly fixed to Hotori's hip.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"There is indeed another spellblade there.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"The blade Hotori has been holding in reserve for\nKokuan-dono's use─",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Shiranui.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You scared?”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Too scared to draw Shiranui?”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Nng...!”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			{
"Hotori's hands find their way to Shiranui's hilt, but move no further.",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"Even as her knuckles tremble and grow white, she does not find her resolve.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Shiranui only reveals its true form to the head of House Inou.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“As soon as you draw it, your status'll be plain for all to see.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“That's why you won't do it, ain't that right?”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You're wrong.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“This is Father's spellblade. That's why I...”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"Up until now, Hotori has denied her status as head of House Inou and chairman of the Sworn Blades.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"I had believed it was out of deference to Kokuan-dono, but now that Kokuan-dono is confirmed to be dead, it's obvious.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"Hotori's hesitation has nothing to do with her deference to her father.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"Rather, it has everything to do with her confidence in herself...",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"Hotori has never been able to trust herself ever since the day she led the Myougi Squad to ruin.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"That's why, whether she realized it or not, she has always been hiding in Kokuan-dono's shadow.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"She devoted herself to the Sworn Blades, but only ever as the “acting” chairman─ as Kokuan-dono's replacement.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"And thanks to that, she's managed to avert her eyes from the core of her problems.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			{
"If she has to face her demons eventually, is now not the time?",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Kokuan's kicked the bucket. That's your blade now, no two ways about it.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Go on... draw it.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Draw it and tell me who the hell you are.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"Hotori raises Shiranui aloft for all of us to see.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"And with trembling hands, she slowly draws the blade.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Kgh...”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"All that emerges from the sheath is a dull blade, entirely devoid of light.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"Maki wordlessly stares at Shiranui for a long while, a complex emotion playing across his face.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“No good, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You came this goddamn far and you still couldn't do it, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"Maki slowly approaches Hotori, his blade lowered.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"Hotori's eyes vacantly stare right at Maki, but does she even see him?",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"Her bloodless face is slick with a cold sweat, and she\ndoesn't move a single muscle even as Maki draws closer and closer.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I almost feel sorry for those poor Myougi Squad bastards who died protectin' you.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“But maybe it serves 'em right for not having any eye for a real leader.”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Guuahhh!”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"Hotori is sent flying, crashing into the cold iron bars along the wall.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"She barely raised her guard at the very last second, out of pure instinct more than anything else.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"However, she remains crumpled on the ground, refusing to do as much as stand.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou!?”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Stop!”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"I hold back Akari from trying to intervene.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“This is Hotori's fight.”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			{
"At this, Maki meets my gaze.",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"Unlike before, his feral eyes are not those of a rabid dog.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"The eyes that stare into mine are the lucid eyes of an ageless tiger.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"─It's the same look he gave me back then.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"I think back to Hotori and Maki's showdown in the Sworn Blades headquarters.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"He had the same look in his eyes even as he staved in the conference table and stormed off in a rage.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"There is a method to his madness.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Now that I've heard Mutsumi-san's story, I'm sure of it.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You need to die here.”",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“With you as its chairman, the Sworn Blades'll turn into another Myougi Squad.”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"Hotori's motionless body finally reacts to this with a terrible tremor.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"Another... Myougi Squad?",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"Unlike everything else Maki said, these words pierce my ears with a startling clarity.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Maki is right.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"If Shiranui hasn't recognized me, it means I'm not fit to be the head of House Inou.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"If I remain as their chairman, I'll surely hurl everyone headlong into bottomless perdition.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"...Just as I did three years ago.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"A vision of that battlefield plays itself across the back of my eyelids.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"─The enemy closes in as an endless tide, no matter how many of them I cut down.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"─Their bullets rain down in a ceaseless deluge, turning my comrades into lifeless lumps of flesh. ",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"I'm sorry... I'm so sorry...",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"My reckless orders got you all slaughtered.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"And yet, and yet, I of all people was the only one to survive!",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"Even after all this time, the guilt still haunts me.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"I've done all I can to atone, pouring all my life into serving as the acting chairman, and all my heart into my performances as Natsumi.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"But this is all it amounts to.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"I failed to restore the Empire. I failed to save my father. I failed even to avenge his death.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"In the end, I'm going to die just like this, without accomplishing a single─",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Inou! Stand up!”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"...Miyaguni?",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I ordered you to never give up!”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Did you speak false when you swore to fulfill your duty?!”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“No...”",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"Fealty compels me to finally raise my voice.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"Finally able to see clearly, I look up to find Maki looming above, his spellblade raised.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“!”",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"I immediately leap aside.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"I roll across the cobblestones and land right at Soujin's feet.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"He simply steps back without a word.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"His hands are resting calmly at his side, and his blade still remains in its sheath.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Tokita ain't gonna help you.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“He may be a little punk, but even he knows how this is meant to go. Well, that's what I hate most 'bout him, though.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I shall not save a warrior who would forswear her oath to her lord.”",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh?!”",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What happened to Inou Hotori's fealty?”",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If absolute obedience to your lord is your idea of fealty, then so be it.”",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But now is the time to bet your life on that answer!”",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"Those were the same words I said to Elsa.",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There are things you must fight to protect.”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm not just talking about on the battlefield.”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your country, your comrades, your fealty, your own dignity! All of it can be stolen away from you so easily if you\ndon't stand and fight!”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“And this fight is yours alone, Hotori!”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			{
"Soujin once said, “There are things you must fight to protect.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There could be no greater happiness than being able to protect what's most dear to you with your own strength.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The thought of entrusting their fate to anyone else's hands... I couldn't bear it.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No matter what the outcome might be...”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll always take pride in being able to fight for myself.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			{
"...I can still fight.",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			{
"My heart is still beating, and my arms and legs are still working.",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			{
"And most importantly of all─",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			{
"The fealty that I must protect is still within me.",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"I don't have to entrust it to anyone else.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"I can protect it with my own two hands.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"I stand up, Shiranui in hand.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Wanna have another go?”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Absolutely.”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"I steady my blade.",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"Even as the flickering lamplight dances across its edge, it does not waver in the slightest.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			{
"How could it possibly?",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			{
"Even down to the last, I shall fight to protect my fealty.",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			{
"In this moment, my body is enwreathed with naught but the joy of having been born a warrior.",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			{
"This imperishable conviction of mine scorches away the last of my fear and unease.",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I've kept you waiting too long, Shiranui.”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"Shiranui erupts forth with a torrent of flame hot enough to ignite the air itself.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			{
"An incalescent heat capable of scorching anyone who dares step too close.",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Long time no see, Shiranui.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Now those are the flames of House Inou. I'd never mistake\n'em.”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			{
"In turn, Maki raises aloft the spellblade handed down through generations of House Maki, ",
{"ruby", text="Ebon Iron"},
"Kurogane.",
{"/ruby"},
"",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			{
"Its jet-black magicks envelop Maki's enormous frame.",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			{
"Having come this far, Maki finally unleashes the power of his own spellblade.",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			{
"Kurogane dramatically increases the constitution of its wielder.",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			{
"Its colossal heft can rend apart boulders like rock candy, and despite its innumerable scratches, its edge remains as keen as the day it was forged.",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			{
"Since time immemorial, the head of House Maki has always been found at the tip of the Empire's vanguard.",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			{
"The two square off against each other.",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Maki Kazuma. Head of House Maki.”",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Inou Hotori. Head of House Inou.”",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			{
"Hotori and Maki face each other with less than a single pace separating them.",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			{
"Their overflowing wills collide head-on.",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			{
"Neither intends to back down.",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			{
"The contest will be decided in one single clash─",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Oooaaaaaahhhh!”",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Haaaaaaahhhh!”",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			{
"Flaming red and ebon black intersect─",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			{
"─As Hotori slashes a wide crescent through Maki's flank.",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			{
"It all happened so swiftly even I could barely follow it.",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Ughhh...!”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			{
"Maki kneels down, his stomach split atwain by a searing seam.",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			{
"If not for Kurogane, his torso would have been cleanly dissevered from his body.",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Welp, guess that's all I've got...”",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			{
"After croaking out his capitulation, he tumbles forward.",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Splendid!”",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Highness!”",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			{
"Hotori lays Shiranui at her side and kneels before Akari.",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I beg your forgiveness for that unsightly display.”",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Speak nothing of it.”",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“However, you are not to lose your way again.”",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			{
"Hotori deeply bows her head.",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I should never have spoken so frivolously to the head of House Inou.”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			{
"Hotori raises her head to meet my gaze.",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, I...”",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Forget about it.”",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I shall.”",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“But just let me say this before I do.”",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Thank you for everything.”",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			{
"After we disarm Maki, we examine Kokuan-dono.",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...This isn't Father. It's someone else.”",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? What do you mean?”",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I can't make out his features, but he has a tattoo that my father doesn't.”",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“His musculature isn't that of a warrior either.”",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			{
"I turn my gaze to Maki, still slumped against the wall behind us.",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“The lot of you are all goddamn idiots.”",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Kokuan was never here in the first place.”",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Okonogi lured you out, and you fell for it.”",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“So it was a trap...”",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Why are you the only one here, then? What happened to the rest of the Forbidden Guard?”",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“They decided to foist the job on the new recruit.”",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Said they're scared of fighting warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Some Forbidden Guard they are... Haha...”",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			{
"It doesn't add up.",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			{
"It makes no sense to lure us all the way out here, only to leave everything up to just Maki.",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Maki, could you have been trying to protect us from the Forbidden Guard?”",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			{
"Is that why he fought us all on his own?",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Miyaguni, was it?”",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I don't know who the hell you are, but you don't gotta say anything more.”",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“*Cough... cough, cough...*”",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			{
"Blood leaks out from the corner of his mouth.",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			{
"His internal organs must be a mess.",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It seems I owe you my gratitude.”",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Fuck off with that...”",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Just get yourself back in one piece and take good care of the Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			{
"A light pair of footfalls approaches from the distance.",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Inago's here too, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			{
"Just as Maki says, Koyuzu comes running, her face deathly pale.",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Haah...! Haah, haah... We have trouble!”",
			},
		},
		[315]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Elsa's unit will be upon us at any moment!”",
			},
		},
		[316]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Elsa?!”",
			},
		},
		[317]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“That blonde chick, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[318]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Like hell she was just gonna sit back and watch...”",
			},
		},
		[319]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“M-Maki-sama?!”",
			},
		},
		[320]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Inago, which way're they coming from?”",
			},
		},
		[321]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“H-How dare you betray...”",
			},
		},
		[322]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Answer the fuckin' question!”",
			},
		},
		[323]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“The entrance we came from. That's where Elsa is now.”",
			},
		},
		[324]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“But I can also sense a separate detachment approaching from deeper within the palace...”",
			},
		},
		[325]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Alrighty.”",
			},
		},
		[326]={
			{
"Maki staggers heavily to his feet.",
			},
		},
		[327]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We need to retreat.”",
			},
		},
		[328]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Tokita, gimme Kurogane.”",
			},
		},
		[329]={
			{
"I can see it in his eyes.",
			},
		},
		[330]={
			{
"Maki intends to serve as our rearguard.",
			},
		},
		[331]={
			{
"I hand back Kurogane to him.",
			},
		},
		[332]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We're counting on you.”",
			},
		},
		[333]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You lot get your asses outta here.”",
			},
		},
		[334]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Maki, are you─”",
			},
		},
		[335]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Lemme make my grand exit here, acting chairman.”",
			},
		},
		[336]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Nah... Madam chairman.”",
			},
		},
		[337]={
			{
"Maki amends his words.",
			},
		},
		[338]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The Blades need you.”",
			},
		},
		[339]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Ain't no time to be worryin' about old bastards anymore.”",
			},
		},
		[340]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Not Kokuan, and not me.”",
			},
		},
		[341]={
			{
"So he's been referring to himself as well, all this time.",
			},
		},
		[342]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Get goin' already, chairman.”",
			},
		},
		[343]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“...Thank you.”",
			},
		},
		[344]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I shall never forget such fealty.”",
			},
		},
		[345]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“The hell's that mean?”",
			},
		},
		[346]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Get a move on, already!”",
			},
		},
		[347]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We shall meet again!”",
			},
		},
		[348]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“This way!”",
			},
		},
		[349]={
			{
"With Koyuzu leading the way, Hotori and Akari start sprinting down the path we came from.",
			},
		},
		[350]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Get your ass goin' already.”",
			},
		},
		[351]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Thank you for what you've done for Hotori.”",
			},
		},
		[352]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You ain't forgotten your promise with Kokuan, have you?”",
			},
		},
		[353]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So you knew.”",
			},
		},
		[354]={
			{
"During the August Incident, Kokuan-dono entrusted Hotori to me.",
			},
		},
		[355]={
			{
"That's what Maki is talking about.",
			},
		},
		[356]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I will protect Hotori.”",
			},
		},
		[357]={
			{
"Kazuma nods.",
			},
		},
		[358]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Don't you dare die in a place like this.”",
			},
		},
		[359]={
